  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5Ri1IxW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"577\" height=\"319\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>添加了使用Create模组机器制作的波霸奶茶和咖啡等饮品。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">超过40种口味可以自动化制作！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5ltNTbl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"603\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/M2UUrec.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"237\"></p><p><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/AWuqkC9Xmx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://static.vecteezy.com/system/resources/previews/006/892/625/original/discord-logo-icon-editorial-free-vector.jpg\" alt=\"Discord Logo Icon editorial vector 6892625 Vector Art at Vecteezy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/dev_myst\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.vecteezy.com/system/resources/previews/002/534/045/original/social-media-twitter-logo-blue-isolated-free-vector.jpg\" alt=\"Twitter Bird Icon Vector Art, Icons, and Graphics for Free Download\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><br></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更多口味：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pams-harvestcraft-2-trees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pam's Harvestcraft 2 Trees</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pams-harvestcraft-2-crops\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pam's Harvestcraft 2 Crops</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/croptopia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Croptopia</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/atmospheric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Atmospheric</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/environmental\" rel=\"nofollow\">Environmental</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/autumnity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Autumnity</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neapolitan </a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">其他推荐的食物模组：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seasonals\" rel=\"nofollow\">Seasonals(需要Atmospheric和Autumnity)</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/peculiars\" rel=\"nofollow\">Peculiars(需要Atmospheric)</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pams-harvestcraft-2-food-core\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pam's Harvestcraft 2 Food Core</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pams-harvestcraft-2-food-extended\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pam's Harvestcraft 2 Extended (需要Pam's Trees和Crops)</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\">建议或问题请前往Github的Issues页面。</span></strong></span><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\">可以在本页的第4个标签页找到，标签名为“Issues”</span></strong></h3><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">注意：1.16版本不受支持，可能不会收到很多更新</span></p>",
